      "Language": "dan",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The authors report three case stories of patients who experienced a transient syndrome consisting of headache with neurologic al deficits and CSF lymphocytic pleocytosis (HaNDL). The diagnostic criteria for this benign syndrome are presented and differential diagnoses are discussed."},
